
BTW ---- RESETMACH: reinicia el estado de la maquina entre tests ----
HOW IZ I RESETMACH
  RULES R I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  NRULES R 0
  BASE R I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  BLEN R 0
  OUTB R I IZ MKBUKKIT MKAY
  OUTN R 0
  STEPS R 0
  STAT R "RUNNING"
  LINENO R 0
  MODE R "rules"
  MAXS R 200000
  FOUND YR 1
IF U SAY SO
